            "text": "久安如山…倒是不错。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133601",
      "subQuestName": "与霖铃对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413360101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413360101": {
            "id": "413360101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "唔…还是去现场取材一下吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360102"
            ]
          },
          "413360102": {
            "id": "413360102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你在做什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360103"
            ]
          },
          "413360103": {
            "id": "413360103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "我正在帮人想一些适合写在霄灯上的话呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360104"
            ]
          },
          "413360104": {
            "id": "413360104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "海灯节期间，大家不是都要放霄灯吗，也会在上面写一些愿望啦，祝福语啦之类的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360105"
            ]
          },
          "413360105": {
            "id": "413360105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "为了显得有些节日的氛围，有的人就想要把那些愿望和祝福语，写得…嗯…怎么说呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360106"
            ]
          },
          "413360106": {
            "id": "413360106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "有「文采」一些…这样子。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360107"
            ]
          },
          "413360107": {
            "id": "413360107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "碧波，枭总管和德贵就拜托我，帮他们想一些有「文采」的祝福语，然后写在霄灯上送给他们。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360108"
            ]
          },
          "413360108": {
            "id": "413360108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "但如果我只是在这闭门造车的话，肯定也想不出什么好词。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360109"
            ]
          },
          "413360109": {
            "id": "413360109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "所以，我想要先把霄灯准备好，然后再去观察一下那些拜托我的人，再为他们量身定做一份祝福语。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360110"
            ]
          },
          "413360110": {
            "id": "413360110",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "但我可不怎么会编霄灯啊…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360113"
            ]
          },
          "413360113": {
            "id": "413360113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "是吗？那就拜托你了，拜托你帮我做三盏霄灯来吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360114"
            ]
          },
          "413360114": {
            "id": "413360114",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "然后我们再去实地取取材，看看该写什么祝福语好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360115"
            ]
          },
          "413360115": {
            "id": "413360115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "嘿嘿，我差不多有思路了，只要再找到一点点灵感…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133602",
      "subQuestName": "将三盏霄灯交给霖铃",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413360201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413360201": {
            "id": "413360201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "怎么样，三盏霄灯都准备好了吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133603",
      "subQuestName": "与霖铃对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413360301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413360301": {
            "id": "413360301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "嗯，这些就足够了，我们先去枭总管那边看看吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133604",
      "subQuestName": "前往枭总管附近",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413360401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413360401": {
            "id": "413360401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "枭总管在那边，我们先在这里观察一下吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360402"
            ]
          },
          "413360402": {
            "id": "413360402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "我想想啊，我对枭总管印象很深，给他的那幅字很快就写好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360403"
            ]
          },
          "413360403": {
            "id": "413360403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "我给你念一下啊…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360404"
            ]
          },
          "413360404": {
            "id": "413360404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "「臭脸老头没半点好脾气」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360407"
            ]
          },
          "413360407": {
            "id": "413360407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "「虽如此却有一幅热心肠」…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133605",
      "subQuestName": "将霄灯交给枭总管",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413360501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413360501": {
            "id": "413360501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "枭总管",
            "text": "是霖铃啊，有什么事吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360502"
            ]
          },
          "413360502": {
            "id": "413360502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "上次你拜托我写的那幅字，我已经和这位旅行者一起写好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360503"
            ]
          },
          "413360503": {
            "id": "413360503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "喏，我已经帮你写在霄灯上了，给你。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360504"
            ]
          },
          "413360504": {
            "id": "413360504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "枭总管",
            "text": "那真是谢谢了，我看看…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360505"
            ]
          },
          "413360505": {
            "id": "413360505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "枭总管",
            "text": "「晚辈来，怒目金刚八面威风」，「千帆去，无忧安眠鼾响震山」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360506"
            ]
          },
          "413360506": {
            "id": "413360506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "枭总管",
            "text": "「久安如山」…呵呵，倒是还不错，多谢你了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360507"
            ]
          },
          "413360507": {
            "id": "413360507",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "不用谢，我这里还有一幅我自己写的呢，我念给…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360510"
            ]
          },
          "413360510": {
            "id": "413360510",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "对哦，好吧…那我们先去找德贵吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360511"
            ]
          },
          "413360511": {
            "id": "413360511",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "我给德贵写的那幅字，可是我的得意之作，过去了再和你说。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133606",
      "subQuestName": "前往德贵附近",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413360601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413360601": {
            "id": "413360601",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "看到德贵了吧，我们在这里观察一下吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360602"
            ]
          },
          "413360602": {
            "id": "413360602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "你知道德贵吗？我反正对他店里卖的酒印象很深…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360603"
            ]
          },
          "413360603": {
            "id": "413360603",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "唔，给他的那幅字，其实我也早就想好了，我念给你听。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360604"
            ]
          },
          "413360604": {
            "id": "413360604",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "「人说三碗不过港」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360607"
            ]
          },
          "413360607": {
            "id": "413360607",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "「吃了三碗真不够」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360608"
            ]
          },
          "413360608": {
            "id": "413360608",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "唔…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360609"
            ]
          },
          "413360609": {
            "id": "413360609",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "确实还不错…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360610"
            ]
          },
          "413360610": {
            "id": "413360610",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "题头就写…「还算好人」！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133607",
      "subQuestName": "将霄灯交给德贵",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413360701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413360701": {
            "id": "413360701",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "德贵",
            "text": "霖铃？有什么事吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360702"
            ]
          },
          "413360702": {
            "id": "413360702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "上次你拜托我写的那幅字，我已经和这位旅行者一起写好啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360703"
            ]
          },
          "413360703": {
            "id": "413360703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "还帮你写在了霄灯上，喏，给你。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360704"
            ]
          },
          "413360704": {
            "id": "413360704",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "德贵",
            "text": "哦唷，多谢多谢，我来看看…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360705"
            ]
          },
          "413360705": {
            "id": "413360705",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "德贵",
            "text": "「碗底醪糟层层积厚，汤里丸子粒粒如珍」…「浓淡自知」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360706"
            ]
          },
          "413360706": {
            "id": "413360706",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "德贵",
            "text": "不错不错，读得感觉也不错，谢谢了啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360707"
            ]
          },
          "413360707": {
            "id": "413360707",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "不用谢不用谢，主要是这位旅行者给的灵感。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360708"
            ]
          },
          "413360708": {
            "id": "413360708",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "对了，我自己也写了一幅，记在纸上了，你有空的话也可以看看。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360709"
            ]
          },
          "413360709": {
            "id": "413360709",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "德贵",
            "text": "成，那就多谢你了，我还得回去照顾生意，就先走了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360710"
            ]
          },
          "413360710": {
            "id": "413360710",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "德贵",
            "text": "「人说三碗不过港，吃了三碗真不够」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360711"
            ]
          },
          "413360711": {
            "id": "413360711",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "好了，那我们接着去碧波那边吧，他也找我订了一盏霄灯呢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133608",
      "subQuestName": "前往碧波附近",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413360801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413360801": {
            "id": "413360801",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "前面就是碧波了，我们先在这里观察看看…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360802"
            ]
          },
          "413360802": {
            "id": "413360802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "嗯…我听说，他总是做一些神神秘秘的生意，但是他人其实还不错…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360803"
            ]
          },
          "413360803": {
            "id": "413360803",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "唔，我之前想了一个比较完整的，也很适合他。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360804"
            ]
          },
          "413360804": {
            "id": "413360804",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "「白天鬼祟一条大鼠」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360807"
            ]
          },
          "413360807": {
            "id": "413360807",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "「入夜才知人品还行」…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133609",
      "subQuestName": "将霄灯交给碧波",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413360901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413360901": {
            "id": "413360901",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "碧波",
            "text": "咦？是霖铃啊，上次我拜托你的事…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360902"
            ]
          },
          "413360902": {
            "id": "413360902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "放心吧，这位旅行者和我一起写好了，喏，给你。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360903"
            ]
          },
          "413360903": {
            "id": "413360903",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "碧波",
            "text": "这么快，真是谢谢你了，我看看…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360904"
            ]
          },
          "413360904": {
            "id": "413360904",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "碧波",
            "text": "「往来生鲜货，碧海泛清波」…嗯，不错，很合适。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360905"
            ]
          },
          "413360905": {
            "id": "413360905",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "其实我还写了一段，一起给你吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360906"
            ]
          },
          "413360906": {
            "id": "413360906",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "碧波",
            "text": "还有一段，那我得好好看看，嗯…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360907"
            ]
          },
          "413360907": {
            "id": "413360907",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "碧波",
            "text": "白天鬼祟一条…咳！这，这…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360908"
            ]
          },
          "413360908": {
            "id": "413360908",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "怎么样，是不是很贴切，要是你喜欢的话，自己再编一盏霄灯写上去吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360909"
            ]
          },
          "413360909": {
            "id": "413360909",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "碧波",
            "text": "咳…咳！谢谢了啊，我还有点事，就先回去了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360910"
            ]
          },
          "413360910": {
            "id": "413360910",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "嗯，这样…霄灯就都送完啦，辛苦你了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360911"
            ]
          },
          "413360911": {
            "id": "413360911",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "看起来他们都还挺满意的。看来你和我一样，都挺有这方面的天赋嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360912"
            ]
          },
          "413360912": {
            "id": "413360912",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "唉，这座城里，像你一样能接上我话的人可不太多。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360913"
            ]
          },
          "413360913": {
            "id": "413360913",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "霖铃",
            "text": "要是你以后有空的话，就多来找我们，我们再一起研究一下诗文吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413360914"
            ]
          },
          "413360914": {
            "id": "413360914",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "一定，一定…",
